  "body": "Over in https://github.com/whatwg/meta-theme-color/ @pornel had a couple important pieces of feedback (from using this feature on the Financial Times) which we failed to take into account before merging in the theme-color spec in #720:\n- [ ] https://github.com/whatwg/meta-theme-color/issues/10 specify that theme-color should be used as a background-color in browser UI\n- [ ] https://github.com/whatwg/meta-theme-color/pull/11 discourage color adjustment whenever possible, and adjust the example of adjustment to one that only slightly changes the color instead of completely changes it\n\n@pornel has said he would PR these when he had time.\n",
